<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>HEAT ME UP</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sundiver</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">40ghXIQ9osfMCT7g49QNPE</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.970" end="00:27.180">Thin skinned as a polythene bag</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.180" end="00:31.170">You pump me up with more air than I already had</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.170" end="00:39.170">I wish I could see what you saw in me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.450" end="00:45.060">Different than all of your friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.060" end="00:49.530">Working all the hours that your maker sends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.530" end="00:53.310">But you show me someone that nobody can see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.310" end="00:54.810">You heat me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.580" end="01:01.580">You cool me down like I need you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.430" end="01:21.930">You heat me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.700" end="01:22.200">You cool me down like I need you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.330" end="01:23.640">I’d keep you in a glass box I can see through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.640" end="01:28.350">I’d kill anybody if you ever asked me to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.350" end="01:36.350">When the waters warm, then so are you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.920" end="01:42.090">You try to fix it, but it was always beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.090" end="01:45.360">You try replacing, something that’s Irreplaceable</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.360" end="01:53.360">Momentary flaws</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.050" end="02:14.550">You heat me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.320" end="02:14.820">You cool me down like I need you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.950" end="02:15.450">You heat me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.310" end="02:22.310">You cool me down like I need you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.230" end="02:32.730">You heat me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.500" end="02:33.000">You cool me down like I need you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.130" end="02:33.630">You heat me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.400" end="02:33.900">You cool me down like I need you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.030" end="02:41.030">Alite, you showed me yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.000" end="02:43.500" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I keep you in a glass box that’s see through)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.960" end="02:45.360">&amp; I drained your mana</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.360" end="02:50.550" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I’d kill anyone if you ever asked me to)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.550" end="02:52.050">Let yourself unfurl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.030" end="02:52.530">You heat me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.300" end="02:59.300">You cool me down like I need you to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.270" end="03:08.490">You heat me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.490" end="03:12.490">You cool me down like I need you to</p></div></body></tt>